    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d145">

                <pb facs="0163" n="151" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg151"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00/1089: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Denmark</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Owsley</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-04-22T13:00:00+01:00">April 22, 1939—1
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received April 22—9:45 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>19. Legation’s April 18, 4 p.m.,<anchor n="31" xml:id="d145-f1"/> and
                    Department’s telegram April 20, 7 p.m. Danish Government remains silent with
                    regard to President’s message and no comment is promised.</p>
                <p>German Government has inquired of Danish Government whether latter fears its
                    security menaced by the former and whether the Danish Government requested
                    action taken by the President or was consulted in advance with regard thereto.
                    Danish Government has replied no to the first question and that it did not know
                    of the President’s action in advance or was its opinion asked.</p>
                <p>My opinion is that the Danish Government will follow the lead of the Swedish
                    Government with regard to the President’s message and developments arising
                    therefrom.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Owsley</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
